WEBVTT

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.430
Oh! Good morning, Lev.
Is the training going well?

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:18.430
"November 28th 8:08 AM
14 Days Till Launch"
Yeah. But she's got her own thing,
so I'm back to being a reserve for now.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.430
"Dormitory - Cafeteria"
Yeah. But she's got her own thing,
so I'm back to being a reserve for now.

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:33.860
Hmm? Long time no see, Lev!
You get fired from monster duty?

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:40.080
Not quite. Iri-- N44 is in
the anechoic altitude chamber.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.790
Ugh. Not that.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.830
For the time being,
you guys are stuck with me.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:47.380
And how's that going?

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:54.380
If she doesn't fulfill her duty,
it'll cause problems for us.

00:00:54.380 --> 00:01:01.350
Excellent. She's been in there for
three days and is still going strong.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:03.850
That's incredible!

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:08.270
I just want to see the Moon
before humans defile it.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:13.820
Irina... What are you
thinking about in there?

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:39.390
"Training Center -
Anechoic Altitude Chamber"

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:48.850
I want this off me.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:10.420
"Irina: The Vampire Cosmonaut"

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:25.450
"Training Separately"

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.580
Today, a special inspector
is visiting from Sangrad.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:30.540
"November 29th 9:02 AM
13 Days Till Launch"
Today, a special inspector
is visiting from Sangrad.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.420
"Training Center - Conference Room"
Lyudmila Kharlova. I've brought a letter
for you candidates from Comrade Gergiev.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:37.550
Lyudmila Kharlova. I've brought a letter
for you candidates from Comrade Gergiev.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:42.510
Fellow comrades: The importance
of this mission to our motherland

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:47.010
is something that needs not
be repeated at this point.

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:53.230
The United Kingdom has selected their
seven pilot astronauts--the Hermes Seven.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:58.020
Therefore, the UZSR must
do the same, but rise above.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:01.650
Our Dream Six--our Mechta Shest.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:05.870
We will select six of our
top-performing elites

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.830
who will become our official cosmonauts.

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:12.040
The selection will take place in January.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:16.750
The pride of our motherland
rests upon your shoulders.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.750
Are you prepared, Comrades?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:19.710
--Yes!
--Yes!

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:21.720
Now that's a good response.

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:24.090
If you wish to observe training--

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:27.930
Before that, are there any questions?

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.890
You. Go ahead.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:35.770
Mikhail Yashin. How is the development
of the ship coming along?

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:40.730
Are you wondering about
the Albinar incident, perhaps?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:47.410
When there was a huge explosion
at Albinar not long ago,

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:52.040
we all were reminded
of another terrible incident.

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:56.040
"5 Months Earlier
Albinar Cosmodrome"

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:26.910
Two experiment dogs died in the launch.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:32.870
It got everyone thinking:
"What if I had been in there?"

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:41.800
Relax. That was unrelated to your mission.
The ship is progressing well.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:46.010
We'll be testing Parusnyĭ Six shortly.

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:50.680
Besides, you guys have N44
as an experiment subject.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:56.770
The UK plans to send a chimpanzee
to space next January,

00:05:56.770 --> 00:06:02.190
but N44 is launching this December.
We're well ahead of them.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:07.820
Either way, our vampire should prove
more useful than some primate.

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:15.290
Th-That's right! After all,
N44's meant to be a stand-in for us!

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.160
That's what she's for.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.670
Yeah. It's a sound plan.

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.630
I'll show you around.

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.090
I can't wait.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.130
"Training Center - Hot Room"

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:31.390
"Training Center - Centrifuge Training"

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:44.610
Though training covers many facets, the
parachute landing is of vital importance.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:48.110
Unless it's done correctly,
the parachuter risks...

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:56.700
Not good! He's in a spin!
If he goes unconscious...

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.580
Hang in there, Yustin!
You'll be all right!

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:11.510
That's too bad. He's out of the running.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.930
Congratulations, Comrade Lev Leps.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.010
Huh?

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:21.690
Since he's out, you've been promoted.
Now you've got another shot.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.440
I can't be happy about
another's misfortune.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.650
Really? I wonder about the others.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:31.780
Comrades! If an accident
like this fazes you,

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.620
you'll never be a hero of the motherland!

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.580
Only six of you will be chosen.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:41.920
Whose name shall be remembered
in our motherland's history?

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:44.880
Who here will be our next hero?

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:51.050
Not so fast. I'm tired
of all this silly training.

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:56.010
Come, Comrade Leps.
There's something I want you to show me.

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:00.930
"Training Center -
Anechoic Altitude Chamber"

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:05.770
What are these questions?
I'm not a little child.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:09.780
When will you let me out?

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:13.240
I wanna take a shower. What day is it now?

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.490
It's time. Lights off.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:23.120
Hmm? So that's N44.
How cute--she's like an animal.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:27.170
N44 is not an animal. Like us, she's a--

00:08:27.170 --> 00:08:29.460
Vampire.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.670
A being like us, but different.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:36.550
Their species is loathed by many.
She's no human.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:42.390
But she... After the experiment,
what will happen to N44?

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:46.730
At this point, who knows? Why do you care?

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:50.940
Ah, you want her
as a cute pet after it's over?

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.650
O-Of course not.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:56.200
Don't bring feelings into your duty.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:09:00.290
The Nosferatu Project
won't tolerate failure.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:06.830
Now then, I should be
getting back. Farewell!

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:14.840
You'll get released tomorrow.
You're almost there! You've got this!

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:32.460
--Experiment subject...
--Dispose of her...

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:45.140
Dispose of her... Will they kill me, too?

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:49.520
No. I won't lose to humans.

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.980
I won't lose... I won't lose...!

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.410
Lev!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:14.960
"November 30th 8:00 PM
12 Days Till Launch"

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.250
You okay?

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.510
You hung in there.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.850
Lev...

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:26.930
Hmm?

00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:36.070
Here's your reward.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.820
Lemon seltzer!

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:42.200
You thought I'd be happy?

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.370
Huh?

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:46.990
Still, it's a waste to toss it,
so I'll drink it.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:56.130
What are you grinning for?

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:58.210
Uh, nothing...

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:05.800
I can't say I'm glad she used my name,
or she might bite me for real.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:09.850
Well, seems you've recovered.

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:15.900
I wish I could say you can rest today,
but there's not enough time.

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:17.820
Let's get back to training.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.280
"December 1st 2:23 AM
11 Days Till Launch"

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:24.450
"December 1st 2:23 AM
11 Days Till Launch"
How bad was the solitude training?

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:26.200
It was nothing.

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.200
Really?

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.700
What? You think I'm lying?

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:34.290
That's not it. I was worried about you.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:38.290
Our first time, none of us
made it past three days.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.460
Yeah? You humans lack willpower.

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:48.260
Maybe. Humans might not be
as great as we think we are.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:51.390
Yeah. I truly believe that.

00:12:56.520 --> 00:13:01.400
Yeah. I think so, too. Really.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.750
"December 2nd 8:18 PM
10 Days Till Launch"

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.130
"Training Center - Hot Room"
Is it true, Lev?

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:23.170
"Training Center - Hot Room"
Eh?

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:23.720
"Training Center - Hot Room"
That you took N44 parachuting right away.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:27.340
That you took N44 parachuting right away.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:31.510
Yeah. Parachuting is all about experience.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:36.900
I wanna take her as much as possible.
It could save her life.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:38.980
What a harsh instructor.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:45.530
I don't care if she thinks I'm harsh.
I will not let her die. I won't.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.330
You like her, don't you?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.410
--Huh?
--You do.

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:57.500
Wh-What are you saying? I'm her monitor.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:01.090
I might have to leave the city soon.

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:03.840
Franz? Are you quitting?

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:07.760
No. Transferring, I think.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:11.300
Is it the Vice-Director's doing?
You can talk to me if--

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.770
It's fine. Forget it.

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:19.270
Now then, it's time to save
the princess from the hell room, Lev.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.480
Hmm? Right.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:29.660
Listen... Going solo is
the same routine as tandem.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:35.540
Float on your belly and use your hands
and arms to control yourself.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:39.710
After you pull your chute,
aim for the landing zone.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:41.750
Don't forget to tuck your chin!

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:42.960
Mmm!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.630
Don't worry, I'll be next to you!

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:46.510
Mmm.

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:50.300
Ready whenever!

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:52.180
Okay!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:55.970
Three! Two! One! Zero!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.540
Irina! Your hand!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.000
Lev!

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.350
It's okay! I've got you!

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:40.350
Yeah!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:47.650
Don't look down! Look at me!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.650
It's time!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.710
Yes!

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:12.430
Now to land! Five-point landing!
Feet, calves, thighs, hips, back!

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:22.690
I landed!

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:27.650
Irina! You did it!

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.940
Well done!

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:32.150
Mmm!

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:33.820
Irina!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:40.000
Don't touch me... human!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:46.540
You were off target,
but it's good for your first time.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:48.420
I won't miss next time.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:52.380
No, we'll practice for a spin next.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.760
A spin?

00:16:53.760 --> 00:17:00.720
Yeah. It can happen when you re-enter
the atmosphere and the ejection goes bad.

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:04.980
The pilot falls towards
the ground, spinning rapidly.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:11.280
If it happens, you've gotta regain
control before you pull your chute.

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:15.240
It's that or lose consciousness
and hit the ground.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:21.910
It's no joke. We'll get you
used to it jumping tandem.

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:27.250
This is dangerous. If you think
I'm being harsh, so be it.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.840
--I don't.
--Huh?

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:35.760
I don't think you're being harsh.
It's training to come home safe, right?

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:37.590
Y-Yeah.

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.760
An experiment to dispose of...

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:40.810
Huh?

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:47.480
That's how I'm treated here.
And yet, you wanna help me live.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:49.110
Irina...

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:52.940
You're weird for not
treating me like an object.

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:59.820
Well, I guess. But I wanna go to space.
You're a comrade that shares my dream.

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.700
You can think that, but to me,

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:10.340
humans are the enemy that killed
my parents and burned my village.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:12.750
Right. Sorry.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:17.260
Don't apologize. It doesn't
make sense for you to.

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:27.230
Still, you're about the only
human I think isn't bad.

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:28.310
What?

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:30.270
That's all I'm gonna say.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:34.070
Hmm? What's that?

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:35.070
Huh?

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.660
A meteorite?

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:50.040
--What was that?!
--Let's go see.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.800
"December 3rd 5:10 AM
9 Days Till Launch"

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:01.220
Is that a cabin? Why would one...?

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:06.270
We'll be testing Parusnyĭ Six shortly.

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:08.180
You don't think...?

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:10.230
Hey, Lev. Look!

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:17.650
They were supposed to launch
a dog. That's probably...

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:45.720
Irina!

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:49.480
You okay, Irina?

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.810
Keep it together.

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:53.730
Lev!

00:19:53.730 --> 00:19:56.780
I want you to explain everything.

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:03.870
I thought the launch
of Parusnyĭ Six was successful.

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.780
It was successful.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:08.790
"Albinar Cosmodrome - Control Room"
It maintained orbit
and all the data was good.

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.290
It maintained orbit
and all the data was good.

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:12.370
So, what happened?

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:16.540
However, there were
issues during re-entry.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:21.260
Due to problems with the
heat shield and re-entry angle,

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:24.300
we issued the flight termination command.

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:27.390
You blew it up, then.

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:31.600
So, will N44's launch
proceed as scheduled?

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:34.270
The plan must not be held up.

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:37.190
--Yes.
--At what success rate?

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:40.070
At the moment, 30%.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.450
I heard it'd be 50%.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:45.780
With improvements,
we'll reach that by launch.

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:53.000
Good. Well, I wager we'll fill the cabin
with explosives for when it happens.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.120
That's--!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:58.290
She's an experiment subject.
No different than a dog.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:06.010
In the event it lands in another country,
we must preserve our secrets.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:06.970
Right.

00:21:06.970 --> 00:21:09.930
Anything for our great Motherland.

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:16.650
Comrade Chief!

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.440
I'm all right.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:21.940
Surely, next time...!

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:28.490
I think you know,
but keep quiet about this.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:29.330
Right.

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:32.950
It's a shame that you had to witness that.

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:41.130
Is she okay? If she's
unable to fulfill her duty...

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:47.800
She's just experiencing shock.
N44 will recover. I'll make sure of it.

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:55.640
Unless you're right, they won't stop
at your head. They'll take mine, too.

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:50.970
"Next Episode:
'Nosferatu'"
